        <h2 id="article-heading" class="cmp-main-heading">Featured Article</h2>
        <p class="cmp-main-text cmp-main-text-margins">Recognized by Revista Business Portugal in the article <em>Restaurante Bueni: Da Moldávia para Portugal</em>, as part of their Algarve 360º series. It tells the story of founder Sergiu Bucsa and the journey that brought him from Moldova, through Romania and Italy, to finally settling in Lagos. It explores the experiences, values, and passion that helped shape Bueni, highlighting a commitment to quality ingredients and a dining experience built around family, tradition, and hospitality.</p>
        <p class="cmp-main-text cmp-main-text-margins"><em>"With a career marked by resilience, Sergiu Bucsa, originally from Moldova, found the ideal setting in Portugal to bring his projects to life. After the success of Latitude, he launched Bueni in Lagos, a restaurant that values local products, combines tradition with innovation, and transforms each meal into a shared experience, reflecting his own life journey."</em></p>

        <div class="about-container__btn">
